    <briefdescription>
<para>Structure describing a contiguous range of call-sites which reside in the same procedure fragment. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>With -fbasic-block-sections, there will be one call site range per basic block section. Otherwise, we will have one call site range containing all the call sites in the function. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
